## Anti-Patterns to Avoid

Do NOT:
- Skip session plan review
- Skip writing the test first
- Implement without a failing test first
- Access `JpaRepository` directly from the controller
- Put business logic in `@RestController`
- Return `@Entity` objects from the controller
- Skip error handling
- Forget to document shared libraries
- Move to next session with failing tests
- Implement more than one endpoint per session
- Skip session summary documentation
- Automatically start next session
